through things, drilling,

00:04:59.245 --> 00:05:00.380
filtering, slicing, dicing.

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:04.230
It needs to be two seconds,
one second, maybe sub second.

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:05.502
So how do we do that?

00:05:05.502 --> 00:05:06.710
So enough talking about this.

00:05:06.710 --> 00:05:08.377
