are from those states.

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:11.367
So the most is California,
followed closely by Texas.

00:08:11.367 --> 00:08:12.450
That's at the state level.

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:14.320
What if I wanted to
look at the city level?

00:08:14.320 --> 00:08:15.695
What are the cities
with the most

00:08:15.695 --> 00:08:18.340
departures in the
United States for

00:08:18.340 --> 00:08:20.150
domestic commercial flights?

00:08:20.150 --> 00:08:21.970
Well, another
analytic technique is

00:08:21.970 --> 00:08:24.370
to look at data different
ways simultaneously.

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:26.230
So I'm not limited to one chart.

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:28.330
I can add another
chart beside this.

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:33.443
And maybe here, I want to
go add the origin city.

00:08:33.443 --> 00:08:34.860
Before I drag that
in, what do you

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:36.443
think the city is
in the United States

00:08:36.443 --> 00:08:38.610
with the most departures
for domestic flights?

00:08:38.610 --> 00:08:40.890
Anyone want to venture a guess?

00:08:40.890 --> 00:08:41.640
LA.

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:43.020
Anyone else?

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:43.770
JFK.

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:45.270
OK, those are good guesses.

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:46.290
I drag this in.

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:47.950
Drum roll.

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:49.565
It's Chicago.

00:08:49.565 --> 00:08:50.143
There you go.

00:08:50.143 --> 00:08:52.060
And so I'll just make
this a little bit bigger

00:08:52.060 --> 00:08:53.200
so we can easily read it.

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:55.870
Top three Chicago,
Atlanta, Dallas.

00:08:55.870 --> 00:08:59.190
Does anyone know why
those cities are special?

00:08:59.190 --> 00:09:00.060
Connections.

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:03.500
They are the largest hub of the
three largest airlines, United,

00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:06.320
Delta, and American
Airlines respectively.

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:07.060
Cool.

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:10.355
So those are the top cities
with departures in the US.

00:09:10.355 --> 00:09:11.730
MARY PISHNY: All
right, Riccardo,

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:12.960
