00:10:53.870 --> 00:10:56.180
Also interesting
that's catching my eye

00:10:56.180 --> 00:10:59.170
here is there were eight flights
from San Jose to San Francisco.

00:10:59.170 --> 00:11:00.920
If you don't know your
