00:11:10.905 --> 00:11:12.110
MARY PISHNY: I'm going
to start looking.

00:11:12.110 --> 00:11:14.152
RICCARDO MUTI: So yeah,
so these are the insights

00:11:14.152 --> 00:11:16.370
