00:12:01.220 --> 00:12:02.910
OK?

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:05.750
So this is operating on
top of BigQuery BI Engine.

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:07.610
So you might have
recognized that technique

00:12:07.610 --> 00:12:09.320
that I did there as
sort of a drill down,

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:12.380
like I'm drilling down from
