00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:40.700
See the top states.

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:42.920
I can drill back
down to top cities.

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:44.000
This is drill down.

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:46.730
And it's available today
in Data Studio for most

00:12:46.730 --> 00:12:48.277
of the basic chart types.

00:12:48.277 --> 00:12:49.317
MARY PISHNY: Awesome.

00:12:49.317 --> 00:12:50.150
RICCARDO MUTI: Yeah.

00:12:50.150 --> 00:12:50.840
You can applaud that.

00:12:50.840 --> 00:12:51.340
Sure.

00:12:51.340 --> 00:12:53.400
Why not?

00:12:53.400 --> 00:12:55.100
OK, not only can I
